{
  "title": "nopCommerce — Search & Product View",
  "uid": "nopcommerce-search",
  "tags": ["nopcommerce"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [

    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 3 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Customer searches and views a product\nThis dashboard follows a single user journey: the customer types a search query, browses results, and opens a product page. Each row below corresponds to one stage of that journey. Use the **Traces** panel at the bottom to drill into any individual request."
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Searches / min",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 3, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum(rate(nopcommerce_catalog_search_result_count_count[2m])) * 60",
        "legendFormat": ""
      }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "steps": [{ "value": null, "color": "blue" }] } } },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "graphMode": "area", "colorMode": "background" }
    },

    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Median results per search",
      "gridPos": { "x": 6, "y": 3, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(nopcommerce_catalog_search_result_count_bucket[2m])) by (le))",
        "legendFormat": ""
      }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "steps": [{ "value": null, "color": "green" }, { "value": 1, "color": "green" }, { "value": 0, "color": "red" }] } } },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "graphMode": "none", "colorMode": "background" }
    },

    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "5xx Errors / min",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 3, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum(rate(nopcommerce_http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[2m])) * 60 or vector(0)",
        "legendFormat": ""
      }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "steps": [{ "value": null, "color": "green" }, { "value": 1, "color": "red" }] } } },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "graphMode": "none", "colorMode": "background" }
    },

    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Discount applied rate",
      "gridPos": { "x": 18, "y": 3, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum(rate(nopcommerce_catalog_price_discount_calculations_total{discount_applied=\"true\"}[2m])) / sum(rate(nopcommerce_catalog_price_discount_calculations_total[2m]))",
        "legendFormat": ""
      }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "steps": [{ "value": null, "color": "blue" }] } } },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "graphMode": "none", "colorMode": "background" }
    },

    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 7, "w": 24, "h": 2 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Stage 1 — Search\nThe customer types a query. These panels show how many results come back and how often the search returns nothing at all."
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Search result count — p50 / p95",
      "description": "Custom metric: catalog.search.result_count. A sustained drop toward zero — without HTTP errors — means the catalog has a silent availability problem (products unpublished, ACL misconfiguration, search provider failure).",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 9, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(nopcommerce_catalog_search_result_count_bucket[2m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 — half of searches return fewer results than this"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(nopcommerce_catalog_search_result_count_bucket[2m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 — only 5% of searches return more than this"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "lineWidth": 2 } } }
    },

    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Zero-result searches / min",
      "description": "Searches that returned 0 products. A spike here means customers are searching and finding nothing — either a catalog problem or a broken search provider.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 9, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum(rate(nopcommerce_catalog_search_result_count_bucket{le=\"0\"}[2m])) * 60",
        "legendFormat": "zero-result searches / min"
      }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" }, "custom": { "lineWidth": 2 } } }
    },

    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 17, "w": 24, "h": 2 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Stage 2 — Product page & pricing\nThe customer clicks a result and opens the product page. nopCommerce calculates the final price on every page load, applying tier prices and discounts. These panels show how that calculation behaves over time."
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Discount applied rate",
      "description": "Custom metric: catalog.price.discount_calculations. During an active promotion this should be above 0. If it drops to 0 while a sale is live, the discount configuration is broken — this metric catches that before customers notice prices haven't changed.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 19, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum(rate(nopcommerce_catalog_price_discount_calculations_total{discount_applied=\"true\"}[2m])) / sum(rate(nopcommerce_catalog_price_discount_calculations_total[2m]))",
        "legendFormat": "% of price calculations with a discount"
      }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1, "custom": { "lineWidth": 2 } } }
    },

    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Request duration — search & product pages (p50 / p95)",
      "description": "End-to-end HTTP response time for /search and /product routes. If p95 spikes while error rate stays flat, the price calculation or a slow DB query is the likely culprit — drill into the traces panel below to confirm.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 19, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(nopcommerce_http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=~\".*(search|product).*\"}[2m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(nopcommerce_http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=~\".*(search|product).*\"}[2m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "lineWidth": 2 } } }
    },

    {
      "id": 40,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 27, "w": 24, "h": 2 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Stage 3 — Health\nAny HTTP 5xx error on search or product routes means the user saw an error page. This should be zero under normal conditions."
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "HTTP 5xx error rate — search & product pages",
      "description": "Server errors on /search and /product routes. Any sustained value above 0 needs immediate investigation.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 29, "w": 24, "h": 7 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum(rate(nopcommerce_http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"5..\", http_route=~\".*(search|product).*\"}[2m])) * 60 or vector(0)",
        "legendFormat": "5xx errors / min"
      }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" }, "custom": { "lineWidth": 2 } } }
    },

    {
      "id": 50,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 36, "w": 24, "h": 2 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Traces\nClick any row to see the full span tree for that request: HTTP entry point → catalog.search.products → db.Product.GetById → catalog.price.calculate. Use this to find exactly which step is slow."
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Traces — search & product flow",
      "description": "Live traces from Jaeger for the catalog.search.products operation.",
      "type": "traces",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 38, "w": 24, "h": 12 },
      "datasource": { "type": "jaeger", "uid": "jaeger" },
      "targets": [{
        "queryType": "search",
        "service": "nopCommerce",
        "operation": "catalog.search.products",
        "limit": 20
      }]
    }

  ],
  "templating": { "list": [] }
}
